    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH2F742BA4D710B4EA8FA32528C878B051" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Management believes that the information on this page has been prepared in accordance with the Commission's Opinion 154-B methodology. This presentation on page 700 is not necessarily in the form in which it would appear in connection with a challenge to a particular rate, or rates, and is therefore not intended to be binding in any specific rate litigation.</p>
        <p>
          <strong>Notes:</strong>
        </p>
        <p>Pursuant to the Commission's Remedial Order, issued on November 20, 2025, in Docket No. RM25-2-000, Total Interstate Operating Revenues include amounts recoverable during the Locked-In-Period from March 1, 2022, to September 17,2024.</p>
        <p>Totals may not sum due to rounding.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
